+## Board Publication
+
+Publishing a board makes a read-only version of it available to anyone with its secret public link, without signing in. The board's columns and published cards can also be opened directly from that link. Only board administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board. Publishing a board that is already published keeps its existing public link.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`, including its `public_url`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": true,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/aBcD3fGh1jKLmN0pQrStUvWx",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board. Its public link stops working immediately; publishing the board again generates a new link.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
